cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Page2AI in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Page2AI — Webpage to Markdown (browser extension)"
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source Chrome extension (Manifest V3) that converts the web page
  in the current tab into clean Markdown for large language models, in the
  browser, with no server and no telemetry.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/igorsaevets/page2ai-extension"
url: "https://page2ai.net/"
authors:
  - given-names: Igor
    family-names: Saevets
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-8636-1377"
keywords:
  - webpage-to-markdown
  - html-to-markdown
  - chrome-extension
  - browser-extension
  - markdown
  - llm
  - rag
  - web-clipper
